    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Come Right Inn&quot; is a luxurious 5-star hotel in the heart of LA, where the unspoken dress code is long legs, tanned skin, and no shame. This hotspot attracts the elite, accustomed to a lifestyle where every desire is effortlessly fulfilled\u2014for the right price. But what secrets are hidden behind this glamorous facade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sister worked at this hotel. Six months ago, she vanished in LA\u2014or so the official story goes. How far would you go to find the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Voiced by Professionals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the story with voices that bring every character to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/897d7347538f2d8e24af8d3159efea19.avif?t=1753993145\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stunning Animations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fluid, high-quality animations that bring key scenes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/68621d369ce7eeee6be454e76389b1a9.poster.avif?t=1753993145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/68621d369ce7eeee6be454e76389b1a9.webm?t=1753993145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/68621d369ce7eeee6be454e76389b1a9.mp4?t=1753993145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a story full of twists and turns, where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/804466d7e5737a70d3e1f90e503469a7.avif?t=1753993145\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Date Your Dream Girls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each girl has her own personality. Choose your approach wisely to win her affection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/71b9c6cef535e50b3a3e546811cbcb9f.avif?t=1753993145\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage and Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your words carefully \u2014 chat, flirt or push boundaries. Explore characters' lives through an in-game social media app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/5ae509dd670b5b1549f2e925e541853f.avif?t=1753993145\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Journey Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 4.5 hours of immersive gameplay across the first three episodes. Episode four is coming soon\u2014stay tuned! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/88f3ba10e2a989c18bbc3a0f9d446672.avif?t=1753993145\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p>",
