 seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/804466d7e5737a70d3e1f90e503469a7.avif?t=1753993145\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Date Your Dream Girls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each girl has her own personality. Choose your approach wisely to win her affection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/71b9c6cef535e50b3a3e546811cbcb9f.avif?t=1753993145\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage and Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your words carefully \u2014 chat, flirt or push boundaries. Explore characters' lives through an in-game social media app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/5ae509dd670b5b1549f2e925e541853f.avif?t=1753993145\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Journey Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 4.5 hours of immersive gameplay across the first three episodes. Episode four is coming soon\u2014stay tuned! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241880/extras/88f3ba10e2a989c18bbc3a0f9d446672.avif?t=1753993145\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p>",
